                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/2.9.11"&gt;2.9.11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Features and fixes
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;HGETDEL&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;HGETEX&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;HSETEX&lt;/code&gt; support (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2863" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2863/hovercard"&gt;#2863 by atakavci&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;Condition.SortedSet[Not]ContainsStarting&lt;/code&gt; condition for transactions (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2638" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2638/hovercard"&gt;#2638 by ArnoKoll&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for &lt;code&gt;XPENDING IDLE&lt;/code&gt; time filter (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2822" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2822/hovercard"&gt;#2822 by david-brink-talogy&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;GetServer(RedisKey, ...)&lt;/code&gt; API (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2936" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2936/hovercard"&gt;#2936 by mgravell&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve &lt;code&gt;double&lt;/code&gt; formatting performance on net8+ and fix equality incorrectness re special doubles by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3259749011" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2928" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2928/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2928"&gt;#2928&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix key-prefix omission in &lt;code&gt;SetIntersectionLength&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;SortedSet{Combine[WithScores]|IntersectionLength}&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2863" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2863/hovercard"&gt;#2863 by mgravell&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix error constructing &lt;code&gt;StreamAdd&lt;/code&gt; message (&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2941" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2941/hovercard"&gt;#2941 by mgravell&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal details
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make private &amp;amp; internal stuff sealed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Henr1k80/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Henr1k80"&gt;@Henr1k80&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3246312053" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2915" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2915/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2915"&gt;#2915&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workaround Mono test failures by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3248966732" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2921" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2921/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2921"&gt;#2921&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replaces string interpolation with structured logging - ServerEndPoint by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Meir017/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Meir017"&gt;@Meir017&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3255651127" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2924" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2924/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2924"&gt;#2924&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3256905080" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2925" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2925/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2925"&gt;#2925&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3259950854" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2929" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2929/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2929"&gt;#2929&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3260234384" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2930" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2930/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2930"&gt;#2930&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: Add benchmark suite for easily measuring improvements by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NickCraver/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NickCraver"&gt;@NickCraver&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3263357769" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2931" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2931/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2931"&gt;#2931&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;intellisense clarification for StreamTrimResult.NotDeleted by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3273292912" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2933" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2933/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2933"&gt;#2933&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: Improve stability for AbortOnConnectFailTests by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NickCraver/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NickCraver"&gt;@NickCraver&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3273455544" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2934" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2934/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2934"&gt;#2934&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
